<section class="panel cp-span-half" id="dates">
    <h2>Release Date, Beta and Editions</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Public beta: <strong>September 17, 2026</strong> — early beta access via the Epic and Collection pre-purchase packs, per Blizzard's pre-purchase announcement</li>
        <li>Live Q&A: Thursday, September 17, 2026 at 10:00 a.m. PT</li>
        <li>Global launch: <strong>November 4, 2026 at 3:00 p.m. PST</strong></li>
        <li>First new raids: <strong>December 9, 2026</strong></li>
        <li>Access: included with a WoW subscription / game time; optional pre-purchase packs add beta access and cosmetic items in Forever and retail</li>
        <li>Level cap: 60, permanently — Blizzard confirmed the cap "will always be" 60</li>
    </ul>
</section>

